S4Q3IcHCHEoCg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjLtPH2y9KWAxWpoK8BHXTdNS4Q3YcHCHQoAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjLtPH2y9KWAxWpoK8BHXTdNS4Q3IcHCHMoCw",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["因為沒有提示，在門口疑惑了一下，實測後應該是進店時拉門、出店時推門。\n店內格局一目瞭然：連著烹調區的吧台、十張高腳椅、待位用的長椅，最後端有洗手間。自助區有面紙、常溫水、冰的淡青茶自取。先在點餐機點餐，各項餐點有說明可以點選參看；現金付費，支援電子發票載具；付費後取得小白單，就座後將之交給店內人員。店內人員態度客氣，提醒我可以再加一次麵，也可以再加清湯。\n初來乍到，選擇了「白露花清湯•塩」這種拉麵並加一顆溏心蛋。因到訪時是下雨天，店家增加了配料的肉片量，真是幸運；肉片軟嫩但不失口感，帶著黑胡椒香而不會太鹹，很適合整碗麵淡然有味的調性。溏心蛋真的很溏，但流動的口感中又有濃郁的蛋味跟酒香。\n品名的白露花好像是雞的種類，也好像是因為使用這種雞，所以湯的香氣不像多數拉麵店家那樣動物感很強烈，而是溫和含蓄、在品嘗的過程層層遞進；說實話，受以往的拉麵印象影響，對此反而不太習慣，但有了蔥絲跟洋蔥的加持，仍是從湯的風味變化中感受到樂趣。不過竊以為不適合搭配硬的麵；麵本身的味道會太重，不方便感受湯的優點，略供後來者參考。",null,[0,178]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4166330673747346415/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzUmxsWFdYaGtXRUp2WWpOUmVHUnVVa2RTUjJ4b1kxVjRVV1JZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4166330673747346415/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzUmxsWFdYaGtXRUp2WWpOUmVHUnVVa2RTUjJ4b1kxVjRVV1JZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4166330673747346415/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzUmxsWFdYaGtXRUp2WWpOUmVHUnVVa2RTUjJ4b1kxVjRVV1JZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4166330673747346415/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzUmxsWFdYaGtXRUp2WWpOUmVHUnVVa2RTUjJ4b1kxVjRVV1JZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4166330673747346415/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzUmxsWFdYaGtXRUp2WWpOUmVHUnVVa2RTUjJ4b1kxVjRVV1JZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4166330673747346415/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzUmxsWFdYaGtXRUp2WWpOUmVHUnVVa2RTUjJ4b1kxVjRVV1JZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,7